<title>USA: Hirel to buy Jerry's Marine Service.</title>
<headline>Hirel to buy Jerry's Marine Service.</headline>
<dateline>POMPANO BEACH, Fla. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hirel Holdings Inc said Thursday it had signed a contract to acquire the assets of Jerry's Marine Service, a distributor of marine engines and parts with $14 million in sale for 1996.</p>
<p>The purchase price was not disclosed.</p>
<p>Hirel said its four existing distribution centers, located in New Jersey, will be converted to the Jerry's name.</p>
<p>Jerry's has locations in Fort Lauderdale, Fla., and Charleston, S.C.</p>
